id=hyperos4_recents_source_app_yield
name=HyperOS 4 Recents Source-App Yield
version=1.1
versionCode=15
author=Codex
description=Generic HyperOS 4 module. The latest resumed source app yields through device-defined background cgroups at the earliest Recents signal, with guarded reassertion after ActivityManager transitions. Wallpaper and MIMD briefly yield and then restore. No fixed CPU indices, broad scan, frequency lock, or launcher scheduling change.
